Excuse me a second.

03:28:20.360 --> 03:28:21.140
Hello, everyone.

03:28:21.340 --> 03:28:21.840
I'm here.

03:28:22.470 --> 03:28:23.120
Cheeky monkeys.

03:28:23.280 --> 03:28:23.560
Ooch.

03:28:24.240 --> 03:28:25.260
I'm here with the lovely

03:28:25.260 --> 03:28:26.620
Lynn Redgrave OBE.

03:28:26.990 --> 03:28:27.900
Actually, yes.

03:28:28.020 --> 03:28:28.480
No way.

03:28:28.570 --> 03:28:28.790
Really?

03:28:28.930 --> 03:28:29.450
Oh, yes.

03:28:29.530 --> 03:28:30.000
An OBE.

03:28:30.000 --> 03:28:33.540
OBE is a medal you get in Britain for being famous, right?

03:28:33.560 --> 03:28:39.400
The Queen gives you sometimes some nice things like OBE or knighthoods or those things.

03:28:39.580 --> 03:28:40.200
Do you think I'll get one?

03:28:41.500 --> 03:28:42.640
I think you will.

03:28:43.040 --> 03:28:43.240
Really?

03:28:43.340 --> 03:28:44.460
I think you'll be knighted.

03:28:44.560 --> 03:28:45.760
I think you'll be Sir Craig.

03:28:45.900 --> 03:28:48.820
Sir Craig Ferguson, have you seen my impersonation of Prince Charles?

03:28:50.510 --> 03:28:52.860
But I would love to see it.

03:28:52.920 --> 03:28:57.330
I think when you see that, you'll change your whole idea about me getting a knighthood from...

03:28:57.330 --> 03:29:00.000
You know that when they do the ceremony...

03:29:00.000 --> 03:29:04.560
The audience in the throne room are not supposed to hear what the Queen says, that sort of protocol.

03:29:04.820 --> 03:29:07.340
Does she cuss a lot? I have a feeling that she probably cusses a lot.

03:29:07.360 --> 03:29:10.700
She didn't cuss with me because I'm so classy, but maybe she does.

03:29:10.700 --> 03:29:11.700
Did she say bloody hell?

03:29:11.820 --> 03:29:13.020
No, she didn't say bloody hell, no.

03:29:13.340 --> 03:29:15.460
But there's a little orchestra, and they play music.

03:29:15.600 --> 03:29:18.760
I thought they would play beautiful things like Handel and, you know, Bach.

